{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117982","id":3463359688,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7ObqzI","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117982","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117982.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117982.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117982","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117982/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117982/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117982/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/812ce47ad7bc9dd83d6fa7462a3126e925b2e39b","number":117982,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix property drag activating from inspector preview widgets","user":{"login":"mateo-cabrera","id":146719035,"node_id":"U_kgDOCL7BOw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146719035?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mateo-cabrera","html_url":"https://github.com/mateo-cabrera","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mateo-cabrera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mateo-cabrera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mateo-cabrera/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mateo-cabrera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mateo-cabrera/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mateo-cabrera/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mateo-cabrera/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mateo-cabrera/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mateo-cabrera/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"When clicking and dragging inside a 3D preview (mesh or material) in the inspector, `EditorProperty::get_drag_data()` unconditionally initiates a property name drag. This causes a \"forbidden\" cursor to appear and the property label to be visually selected, even though the user is interacting with the preview widget.\n\nThis adds bounds checks in `get_drag_data()` to reject drags that originate inside `bottom_child_rect` (the preview/bottom editor area) or to the right of the property label text (the content/value area).\n\n**Steps to reproduce (before fix):**\n1. Add a `MeshInstance3D` node and assign any mesh (e.g. `BoxMesh`)\n2. In the inspector, click the mesh resource to expand it\n3. Click and drag inside the 3D mesh preview\n4. Observe: the \"Mesh\" property label gets selected and a forbidden cursor appears\n\n**After fix:** Dragging inside the preview only rotates the mesh, as expected. Dragging the property label still works normally.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com